msgid "plugins.generic.documentCenter.description"
msgstr "One place for everything the journal issues: reviewer certificates, thank-you letters and review forms; receipt, acceptance, publication and regret letters; author appreciation certificates; anonymised reviewer reports. Issue and email them with the right honorific; reviewers see them under “Review Forms” and authors under “My Files” as the editors decide; bulk and automatic sending, full log and public QR verification."

